<title>USA: Duluth ISD 709, Minn., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Duluth ISD 709, Minn., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds said it won $4.625 million of Duluth Independent Sch Dist No. 709, Minn., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1996 B, with a true interest cost of 4.34 percent.</p>
</text>
